Inventory management is an important skill to learn.  What do
you decline to pick up?  What do you drop in a per level pile
that never gets shuttled to another level?  What do you shuttle
from level to level to keep in a camp-stash?  What do you
carry?  The lesson to be learned here is it is important to
carry a means of digging.  If the mattock is too heavy then a
pickaxe will do.  BTW, this is a reason to do the mines before
Sokoban, at least enough of the mines to have a pickaxe.  By
level 10 you will have done the mines a while ago.

